# Weapon cell: Cinder Shaft entered with the SWIRLING AXE (the Expert campaign hero brings it from Crystal Grotto).
# The club route re-timed for the swirling axe's 12-tick recovery: swing groups thrown as fewer throws in the same
# time (two throws break the odd blocks in the cavern; the stinger throw waits 5 ticks longer), every swing in the
# two vaults padded by 10 ticks (the camera is locked in a vault, so the descent waits), a hop over an ember in the
# chute, a step and a hop clear of the magma leapers at the bottom (tests/test_enemies_colossus.gd ARMS_REPAIR).
# w4_l1 "Cinder Shaft" (Expert) from '@' to the exit (ticks:KEYS, keys L R U D F K). The view sinks 1 px per tick:
# never let the hero reach the top edge, and never drop while the floor below is not yet on screen.
# Crater throat: club the boulder beside the start (facing left), then down the long ledges: left, right, left...
